{"seq":2,"slug":"invite-virality-growth-mechanism","title":"邀请裂变机制：分享链路追踪、归因绑定与团群传播模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-group-buying-team-purchase-commerce-engineering/group-leader-virality-fraud-control/invite-virality-growth-mechanism","wordCount":2974,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"邀请裂变机制-分享链路追踪-归因绑定与团群传播模型\">邀请裂变机制：分享链路追踪、归因绑定与团群传播模型</h1><p>拼团业务的增长引擎不在商品页，而在「一个团长把链接发给群友」这一瞬间。工程师要回答的不是「发出去多少条链接」，而是三个可被代码验证的问题：这条链接是谁发的、谁点了它、点击者最终是否成了一位可结算的团员。它们对应<strong>分享链路追踪</strong>、<strong>归因绑定</strong>与<strong>团群传播模型</strong>三层。本篇把三层拆开，并把反作弊信号嵌进归因流程本身——在拼团场景里，归因层的漏洞几乎必然被刷单团伙利用，后置补救的成本远高于在绑定环节拒绝。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从一次点击到一条绑定边\">核心概念：从一次点击到一条绑定边</h2><p>邀请裂变的本质是<strong>在社交图上建立一条有向边</strong>：邀请人 → 被邀请人。链路为「分享 → 点击 → 落地 → 安装/唤起 → 归因 → 绑定 → 奖励」，每一环都可能丢量或造假，因此每个环节都要有独立标识符与一次幂等的落库动作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[团长/邀请人&lt;br/&gt;发起分享] --&gt; B[生成短链&lt;br/&gt;携带 share_token]&#10;  B --&gt; C[群友点击&lt;br/&gt;重定向服务记录 click_id]&#10;  C --&gt; D{落地环境}&#10;  D --&gt;|已安装| E[Universal Link / App Link&lt;br/&gt;深链唤起并回传 click_id]&#10;  D --&gt;|未安装| F[应用商店&lt;br/&gt;延迟深链或 Install Referrer]&#10;  E --&gt; G[归因服务&lt;br/&gt;窗口内匹配]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H{去重与反作弊&lt;br/&gt;自邀请/设备农场/归因劫持}&#10;  H --&gt;|通过| I[写入邀请边&lt;br/&gt;invite_edge]&#10;  H --&gt;|拒绝| J[记录拒绝原因&lt;br/&gt;不结算]&#10;  I --&gt; K[成团后触发&lt;br/&gt;奖励结算与明细]\">flowchart TD\n  A[团长/邀请人&lt;br/&gt;发起分享] --&gt; B[生成短链&lt;br/&gt;携带 share_token]\n  B --&gt; C[群友点击&lt;br/&gt;重定向服务记录 click_id]\n  C --&gt; D{落地环境}\n  D --&gt;|已安装| E[Universal Link / App Link&lt;br/&gt;深链唤起并回传 click_id]\n  D --&gt;|未安装| F[应用商店&lt;br/&gt;延迟深链或 Install Referrer]\n  E --&gt; G[归因服务&lt;br/&gt;窗口内匹配]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H{去重与反作弊&lt;br/&gt;自邀请/设备农场/归因劫持}\n  H --&gt;|通过| I[写入邀请边&lt;br/&gt;invite_edge]\n  H --&gt;|拒绝| J[记录拒绝原因&lt;br/&gt;不结算]\n  I --&gt; K[成团后触发&lt;br/&gt;奖励结算与明细]</pre><p>四条归因通道的可靠性与隐私代价完全不同，工程上通常<strong>并行采集再择优</strong>而非只依赖一条：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>标识来源</th>\n<th>覆盖场景</th>\n<th>主要限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟深链（Deferred Deep Link）</td>\n<td>MMP 首次启动回传的点击标识</td>\n<td>未安装用户冷启动</td>\n<td>依赖指纹/剪贴板，隐私收紧后命中率下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google Play Install Referrer</td>\n<td>Play 商店写入的 referrer 字符串</td>\n<td>Android 安装归因</td>\n<td>保留 90 天、重装才变（<code>developer.android.com</code> Install Referrer Library 2.2）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SKAdNetwork / 商店归因</td>\n<td>平台签名回传（postback）</td>\n<td>iOS 等隐私受限端</td>\n<td>只给聚合与粗粒度值，无法定位个人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兑换码 / 拼团口令兜底</td>\n<td>用户手动输入或分享码</td>\n<td>所有归因失败场景</td>\n<td>需用户主动操作，转化率低但确定性强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>延迟深链与剪贴板匹配之所以持续收缩，是因为它本质是一次<strong>跨应用标识的推测</strong>：MMP（如 AppsFlyer、Adjust、Branch）在点击落地页时采集设备特征，App 首次启动时再采集一次做概率匹配。SKAdNetwork 4 的「人群匿名阈值」（crowd anonymity）只在该来源样本足够大时才返回细粒度转化值，否则退化为 <code>low/medium/high</code> 粗粒度值并截断来源标识。因此<strong>归因结果本身带有不确定性</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分享链路追踪-带参短链与点击标识\">分享链路追踪：带参短链与点击标识</h2><p>自建短链的价值不在于短，而在于它给平台一个可写入的中间跳转点：域名收到请求时生成全局唯一的 <code>click_id</code> 并落库，记录谁在什么时间点击了哪条 <code>share_token</code>。标识分层必须清晰：<strong><code>share_token</code></strong> 属于分享行为，由邀请人生成，用于区分渠道效果；<strong><code>click_id</code></strong> 属于点击事件，服务端在跳转瞬间生成，是归因主键；<strong><code>invite_code</code></strong> 属于邀请关系，是<strong>人类可读、可手动输入</strong>的兜底标识，用于归因失败时补录。</p>\n<p>参数必须<strong>服务端签名</strong>：把 <code>inviter_id</code> 明文写进 URL 是最常见的漏洞，攻击者改一个数字就能伪装成任意邀请人、窃取奖励或导向小号。正确做法是用密钥对 <code>(inviter_id, activity_id, issued_at, nonce)</code> 做 HMAC 签名，落地时验签，不匹配直接拒绝归因，并限定<strong>有效期</strong>防止旧链接被批量刷。</p>\n<p>唤起阶段依赖系统级深度链接：iOS 的 Universal Links 与 Android 的 App Links 允许 <code>https://</code> 链接在已安装 App 时直接唤起并携带参数，未安装时回落浏览器——这是把 <code>click_id</code> 从 web 带进原生 App 的关键一跳。两个坑：链接域名必须正确配置 <code>apple-app-site-association</code> / <code>assetlinks.json</code>，配置错误会让链接静默回落浏览器而丢参；重定向链路若经过第三方跳转，<code>click_id</code> 可能被截断，跳转服务要保证幂等与参数透传。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归因绑定-规则-窗口与去重\">归因绑定：规则、窗口与去重</h2><p>归因绑定把「一次点击」与「一个主体」连起来并决定奖励给谁。核心不是算法复杂度，而是<strong>规则一致性</strong>：同一份规则必须被归因、结算、风控三方读取，否则会出现「归因算给了 A、结算发给了 B」的对账灾难。拼团通常采用<strong>末次点击归因</strong>（Last-Click）：取转化前时间上最后一次有效点击。窗口越长漏归因越少，但把功劳记给早已失效的点击的概率越高。设备指纹候选的衰减可建模为指数衰减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>convert</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>click</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(t) = e^{-\\lambda t}, \\qquad t = t_{\\text{convert}} - t_{\\text{click}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0935em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">convert</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">click</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 由回看窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 反推（令 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(\\tau) = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = \\ln 2 / \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>）。只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 高于阈值且 <code>click_id</code> 在窗口内唯一时才允许确定性归因。<strong>去重必须由数据库唯一约束保证</strong>：对 <code>(invitee_id, activity_id)</code> 建唯一索引，一个被邀请人对同一活动只产生一条有效邀请边；写入以 <code>(invitee_id, activity_id)</code> 为幂等键，冲突时返回既有边。归因失败是常态而非异常，应定义<strong>三级结果</strong>：确定性归因（设备标识或 Install Referrer 命中）直接结算；概率性归因（仅指纹模糊匹配）先落边标记 <code>pending</code>，待成团/支付等强信号出现后转为可结算；无归因则降级为兑换码补录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"团群传播模型-裂变系数与传播周期\">团群传播模型：裂变系数与传播周期</h2><p>邀请裂变能否持续，可用基本再生数思路量化。设每个被邀请人平均发出的、被有效接受的有效邀请数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>，每次邀请转化为新用户的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，裂变系数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K = i \\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时每一代带来超过一个下一代用户，传播自持；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 持平；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 逐代衰减。但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 不足以判断增长节奏，因为传播有周期。设平均一代用户的传播周期为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>（从成为用户到发出有效邀请），则经时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的累计规模近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(t) = N_0 \\cdot K^{t/T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>常被忽视的结论是<strong>缩短 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 与提高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 同等重要</strong>——把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 从 3 天压到 1 天，在一次活动周期内能让同样的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 产生约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍的规模差异。这正是拼团把「开团后 24 小时内成团」做成默认约束的原因：短窗口强制了传播节奏。拼团传播不均匀，呈<strong>团群结构</strong>：团长的辐射面远大于普通团员。要区分<strong>团长拉新</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>leader</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{\\text{leader}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">leader</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，靠团长激励）与<strong>团员连带</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>member</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{\\text{member}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">member</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，靠「再邀请得奖励」的二级机制）。二级邀请在合规上远比一级敏感（涉及多层分销），因此多数跨境平台<strong>限制层级</strong>——只奖励直接邀请，或仅对成团后的连带给一次性小额激励。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反作弊-把风控信号嵌进归因流程\">反作弊：把风控信号嵌进归因流程</h2><p>归因层是刷单团伙的第一攻击面，因为奖励直接挂在归因结果上。事后对账稽核成本高且追不回已发奖励；正确做法是<strong>在绑定这一跳就做准入判断</strong>，给每条边打上可追溯的风险分。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>作弊形态</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>可观测信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自邀请</td>\n<td>同一人用小号邀请自己</td>\n<td>设备指纹/支付账号/收货地址/IP 与邀请人重合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备农场</td>\n<td>一台设备批量注册与点击</td>\n<td>单设备多账号、启动频率异常、指纹聚集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点击注水</td>\n<td>海量伪造点击抢占末次点击归因</td>\n<td>同 IP 短时大量 <code>click_id</code>、点击转化率畸低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归因劫持</td>\n<td>黑产在真实转化前插入自己的点击</td>\n<td>点击与转化时间差分布异常、来源与画像不符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兑换码盗用</td>\n<td>批量试码或窃取他人邀请码</td>\n<td>单码被多账号使用、输入来源集中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>自邀请的判定要与<strong>成团语义</strong>对齐：拼团要求两人<strong>最终成团在同一团</strong>才有奖励价值，因此除设备重合外，还要检查是否落在同一收货地址簇、同一支付工具。设备农场用<strong>速度与聚集</strong>信号：单设备在窗口内的安装数、不同账号的注册间隔、指纹相似度聚类。归因劫持需要<strong>时间戳联合规则</strong>：先到者未必赢，而是取「与转化时间最接近且在有效期内、通过风控的有效点击」，这要求点击服务保存完整点击时间序列。奖励发放必须走<strong>可回滚状态机</strong>（<code>pending → eligible → settled → clawed_back</code>）：风控在结算后才发现作弊时，系统要能把 <code>settled</code> 回滚为 <code>clawed_back</code> 并冲正账户——这要求奖励账本与交易账本分离、奖励支出有独立冲正分录；奖励直接打进余额且无流水，是最易造成资损的设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境合规与工程落位\">跨境合规与工程落位</h2><p>跨境拼团把邀请链路铺到多个法域，追踪能力因此受法律约束。三条最实际的边界：其一，<strong>Cookie 与追踪同意</strong>——英国 ICO 关于 PECR 的指引明确，非必要 Cookie 需要用户事先、主动、知情的同意，继续浏览不构成同意，且 PECR 适用于所有 Cookie 而非仅个人数据型，因此落地页的归因像素、剪贴板读取、指纹采集都须先取得同意（<code>ico.org.uk</code> PECR 指南）。其二，<strong>激励披露</strong>——美国 FTC 的 Endorsement Guides（16 C.F.R. Part 255，2023 年修订）要求：当推荐者与品牌存在可能影响推荐可信度的关系（返现、折扣、佣金、抽奖资格）时，必须在推荐内容中「清晰显著地」披露且每次广告都披露，因此披露文案应作为分享模板的<strong>强制字段</strong>由系统生成（<code>ftc.gov</code>）。其三，<strong>跨端标识聚合化</strong>——ATT、SKAdNetwork 与 Android 隐私沙盒都把标识能力从个人级推向聚合级，归因数据跨境回传需评估出境合规与最小化。落到存储，邀请裂变最小需要三张表：点击表（以 <code>click_id</code> 为主键并保留完整时间序列以支撑劫持检测）、邀请边表（以 <code>(invitee_id, activity_id)</code> 唯一，字段含 <code>inviter_id</code>、<code>source_click_id</code>、<code>confidence</code>、<code>risk_score</code>、<code>status</code>）、奖励账本（独立记账并支持冲正）。归因与结算服务之间要有一份<strong>共享规则配置</strong>（回看窗口、衰减参数、风控阈值），由同一份配置驱动两侧，避免规则漂移造成对账差异。<strong>可观测性</strong>同样关键：要能按 <code>share_token</code> 与团长维度实时计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 与各级转化率，运营才能及时调整激励。归因链路（<code>../1_group-buying-model-group-as-order/2_group-as-order-aggregate-model.md</code>）产出的邀请边最终喂给成团引擎（<code>../2_group-formation-engine-inventory-pricing/1_group-formation-lifecycle-engine.md</code>）判定「邀请人与被邀请人是否同团」——这是拼团邀请区别于普通推荐计划的关键约束；奖励规则的配置化建模见 <code>../1_group-buying-model-group-as-order/3_group-rule-template-configuration.md</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>邀请裂变 = 在社交图上建一条有向边，链路为「分享 → 点击 → 落地 → 安装/唤起 → 归因 → 绑定 → 奖励」，每环都要独立标识与幂等落库。</li>\n<li>四条归因通道（延迟深链、Install Referrer、SKAdNetwork、兑换码兜底）可靠性与隐私代价不同，应并行采集再择优。</li>\n<li>短链参数必须服务端签名并设有效期；明文 <code>inviter_id</code> 是最常见的伪造入口。</li>\n<li>归因要区分确定性、概率性与无归因三级，把不确定性显式建模。</li>\n<li>裂变系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K = i \\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 自持增长；传播周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 同等重要，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(t) = N_0 K^{t/T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.038em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>反作弊必须在绑定环节做准入；奖励走可回滚状态机（<code>pending → eligible → settled → clawed_back</code>）。</li>\n<li>合规三条边界：PECR 的 Cookie 事先同意、FTC 的激励披露（16 C.F.R. Part 255）、跨端标识聚合化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"邀请裂变机制：分享链路追踪、归因绑定与团群传播模型","id":"邀请裂变机制-分享链路追踪-归因绑定与团群传播模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从一次点击到一条绑定边","id":"核心概念-从一次点击到一条绑定边"},{"level":2,"text":"分享链路追踪：带参短链与点击标识","id":"分享链路追踪-带参短链与点击标识"},{"level":2,"text":"归因绑定：规则、窗口与去重","id":"归因绑定-规则-窗口与去重"},{"level":2,"text":"团群传播模型：裂变系数与传播周期","id":"团群传播模型-裂变系数与传播周期"},{"level":2,"text":"反作弊：把风控信号嵌进归因流程","id":"反作弊-把风控信号嵌进归因流程"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境合规与工程落位","id":"跨境合规与工程落位"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"团长角色与佣金激励模型：分层分润、结算周期与业绩归属","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-group-buying-team-purchase-commerce-engineering/group-leader-virality-fraud-control/leader-role-commission-incentive-model"},"next":{"title":"拼团反作弊：刷团、羊毛党与虚假成团的识别与风控策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-group-buying-team-purchase-commerce-engineering/group-leader-virality-fraud-control/group-buying-fraud-abuse-control"}}